change which language the bot replies in - for you only, in this room only
{command} [auto|list|<code>]
*/{command} see the current language + every available code
*/{command} id use Bahasa Indonesia
*/{command} en use English
*/{command} auto go back to detecting from your client's <lang> tag
*/{command} list see who in this room has already picked a language
the <lang> tag on your client's presence is the automatic default
a manual pick sticks until you run {command} auto
